{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>The fifth time [the word appears]</b><br>אפריון. A canopy, and it has no parallel [elsewhere in Scripture]." "<b>The third time [the word appears]</b><br>אפריון. This is the House that Solomon built, and because of the multiplicity of silver and gold vessels that he placed in the Temple, it is as though its pillars and its base were silver and gold. [And we find that the surface of the walls was silver and gold.]"], :book :song-of-songs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 3, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra's commentary on the Canticles" "http://beta.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH002030344/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:44:46.757522839Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}